{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:17:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac5600a4c1684f809574df0aeb26430e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a52eae588fa7fd2c1606a8a8d4d4a65057dc1e9fdba32976f5dd86b230d97cc0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"mervinpraison/praisonai@43a106db26d3 snapshot 462851b4fd2f608d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27375fbeb4aef1fc4bc67f7a7d56b487f598208ae9cdd1991c44ae16d6a4e76c","slc_adaeb6661e20030f41c8f296591bf12f8e369e51de0625c4ed12d90d9a6b8f14"],"source_ids":["src_9d8940d0cfd752b3be1362afc603db8b"],"text":"A whole agent (model calls, loop, and tools) can be placed on a managed runtime via run_on, e.g. run_on=\"anthropic\" hosted or run_on=\"docker\" self-hosted; invalid targets raise a TypeError.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:17:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac5600a4c1684f809574df0aeb26430e"}
